# E §4.2 step 5 (round 10): a leg that takes a debt above 0 is refused (RUN-PLACE); "the refused leg isn't booked ...
# the place's balance is refused from that point, so everything that reads it later is refused too, and so is every
# read of the refused leg itself (flows of its move over a span that holds it)". pay moves 100.00 PLN from konto into
# the debt loan (opening 0) on 2026-03-10: refused. f1 flows(pay, 2026-03) holds it: refused. f2 flows(pay, 2026-04)
# doesn't: 0.00 PLN. f3 pay.cash.amount reads the leg: refused. f4 flows(konto, 2026-03): konto's balance is refused
# from that point. f5 another move's flows stand: 100.00 PLN. f6 a sum over transfers in March reads pay's leg:
# refused. (Writer 8: pay is a plan, in the day's first batch, whose sign rule is checked together, L §5.10 point 1,
# with L §8.4's message `<place> is <b> after the day's observations and plans of <d>`.)
=== rl.tally
model rl
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place loan: debts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input day: date
input day2: date

move pay: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from konto to loan amount amt

move other: transfers
  on day2
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

ask f1: flows(pay, 2026-03) law 2026-06-30
ask f2: flows(pay, 2026-04) law 2026-06-30
ask f3: pay.cash.amount law 2026-06-30
ask f4: flows(konto, 2026-03) law 2026-06-30
ask f5: flows(other, 2026-03) law 2026-06-30
ask f6: sum(t.cash.amount for t in transfers over 2026-03) law 2026-06-30

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "own"
  day = 2026-03-10 "own"
  day2 = 2026-03-12 "own"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "own"
  opening[loan] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "own"
=== expect
f1: refused: RUN-PLACE loan is 100.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-10
  unfulfilled: pay
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-06-30
f2: 0.00 PLN
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-06-30
f3: refused: RUN-PLACE loan is 100.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-10
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-06-30
f4: refused: RUN-PLACE loan is 100.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-10
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-06-30
f5: 100.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: other
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-06-30
f6: refused: RUN-PLACE loan is 100.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-10
  unfulfilled: other
  unfulfilled: pay
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-06-30
